- [ ] (9) Rework backend :: Lean more into the determenistic nature
	* All entropy is provided by the seed
	- [ ] Ensure spread across all possible values
		* Same Issue as with the v1 of fortuna.
		* I want all u8 values to be provided at some point.
		* Easiest way I see right now: provide lists of 0-255 in different sequences
